{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07485","headline":"过裴舍人故居 · 刘长卿","name":"过裴舍人故居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"惨惨天寒独掩扃，纷纷黄叶满空庭。\n孤坟何处依山木，百口无家学水萍。\n篱花犹及重阳发，邻笛那堪落日听。\n书幌无人长不卷，秋来芳草自爲萤。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07485.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07485","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}